## Interface: 16001, 120105, 50500, 11509
## Title: NextMob
## Notes: One button that targets whatever your current quests want you to kill. Kill objectives and item drops, with exact quest NPCs via QuestieDB.
## Author: martin
## Version: 1.0
## SavedVariables: NextMobDB, QuestTargetDB
## IconTexture: Interface\ICONS\Ability_Hunter_SniperShot
## DefaultState: enabled
## X-Category: Quests & Leveling
## OptionalDeps: QuestieDB
# The packager reads this to know which CurseForge project to upload to. It
# comes from the project's own page, in the About Project box. Until it is
# filled in the packager builds the zip and the GitHub release, and skips the
# CurseForge upload.
# ## X-Curse-Project-ID:
## X-Website: https://github.com/martinwinther/NextMob
## X-License: MIT

# QuestTargetDB above is the database under the addon's former name; Core.lua
# adopts it on load. It can be dropped a couple of versions from now.

